{
"markdown": "- **Key Features:**\n\n- **Auto-loop Videos:** Videos automatically replay when they end.\n- **Always Unmuted Videos:** No need to manually unmute every time you watch a video.\n- **Infinite Zoom:** Zoom photos and videos with no limit.\n- **Permanent Delete:** Delete photos & videos instantly without moving them to \"Recently Deleted\".\n- **Hide Slider:** Hide the small scrubber bar below Photos & Videos.\n- **Picture in Picture (PiP):** Watch videos in Picture in Picture mode.\n- **Camera:** Option to mute the shutter sound when taking photos.",
"useSpacing": false,
